llion in dividends: $1.5 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["APH.buybacks.2025","APH.dividends.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $10.2 billion, up 65.1% from $6.2 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["APH.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","APH.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $33 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $9.2 billion and net income to $5.9 billion.","cites":["APH.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","APH.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","APH.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","APH.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","APH.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","APH.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","APH.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","APH.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","APH.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","APH.d.opinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","APH.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","APH.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","APH.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","APH.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","APH.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $5.1 billion: operating cash flow of $6.5 billion less capital spending of $1.4 billion (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["APH.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","APH.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","APH.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","APH.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","APH.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-09-30","APH.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","APH.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","APH.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","APH.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","APH.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-04-08 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $22.4 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $142 million.","cites":["APH.pay.peoTotal.2025","APH.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $5.8 million in total and $38.4 million actually paid.","cites":["APH.pay.neoTotal.2025","APH.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $432.58 at the end of FY2025, and $236.57 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["APH.pay.tsr.2025","APH.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 170,000 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $136,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["APH.q.employees","APH.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $11.1 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $304 million in short-term investments, and $15.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtAndCapitalLeaseObligations + LongTermDebtAndCapitalLeaseObligationsCurrent). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $4.1 billion (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["APH.cash.2025","APH.sti.2025","APH.debtLong.2025","APH.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"APH":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":37,"read":37,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["NORWITT RICHARD ADAM","President & CEO, director"],["Silverman David M","EVP, Human Resources"],["Lampo Craig A","EVP& CFO"],["D'AMICO LANCE E","EVP, Secretary & GenCounsel"],["D'AMICO LANCE E","See Remarks"],["Lampo Craig A","Executive VP & CFO"],["Livingston Robert","Director"],["Doherty William J","President, CS Division"],["Straub Peter","President, ISS Division"]],"rows":[["S",0,799576,65945990.09,"2026-11-02","2026-11-02","0001104659-26-121973","2026-11-03",0],["S",1,120000,20908476,"2026-08-05","2026-08-05","0001104659-26-091189","2026-08-05",0],["S",2,193200,32324156.76,"2026-08-04","2026-08-04","0001104659-26